## How to read this document

Each section covers one Azure service area. Controls marked **Policy** are
enforced automatically. Controls marked **Recommended** are expected but not
yet policy-enforced.

---

## Compute — Virtual Machines

| Control | Enforcement | Policy name |
|---------|------------|------------|
| No public IP on NIC | Policy (Audit/Deny) | `sp-no-public-ip-on-vms` |
| NSG on every subnet | Policy (AuditIfNotExists) | `sp-require-nsg-on-subnets` |
| Recovery Services backup | Policy (AuditIfNotExists) | `sp-require-vm-backup` |
| Only approved extensions | Policy (Audit) | `sp-require-approved-vm-extensions` |
| Patch management via Update Manager | Recommended | — |
| Anti-malware extension | Recommended | — |

## Storage

| Control | Enforcement | Policy name |
|---------|------------|------------|
| HTTPS-only (`supportsHttpsTrafficOnly`) | Policy (Audit/Deny) | `sp-require-https-storage-accounts` |
| No public access (blob) | Recommended | — |
| Soft delete for blobs | Recommended | — |
| Diagnostic settings to LAW | Policy (DINE) | `sp-diag-settings-deploy-to-law-eh` |

